-- An open stretch — nothing but ground.
--
-- Every chunk vocabulary needs a rest in it. Without one the course is
-- wall-to-wall pipes and the only way through is a metronome.

tile #  pipe   solid  pipe.svg
tile _  ground solid  ground.svg
tile o  cloud         cloud.svg
tile .  sky           sky.svg

